					<meta name="Description" content="Build a guild of heroes and play them all, inspired by classic MMOs. Swap between your own characters mid-fight, fill dungeons and 40-hero raids with them, and master 40 classes in tab-target combat. 24 professions, an auction house and a Chaosborn roguelike endgame class. Solo or 1-5 player co-op.">
			
